# api-guide

Reference the [API documentation](https://docs.acme-platform-example.com/api/v2/reference)
for request formats and authentication details.

## Quickstart

1. Generate an API token from the [developer portal](https://developers.acme-platform-example.com/tokens).
2. Pass it as `Authorization: Bearer <token>` on every request.
3. See the [rate-limit guide](https://docs.acme-platform-example.com/api/v2/rate-limits) for quotas.
